        "exact_quote": "User: I joined an online reading group, but I found it difficult to keep up with discussions. This was supposed to be an exciting opportunity for me to connect with others who share my love for literature. However, the sheer volume of posts and the rapid exchange of ideas often left me feeling overwhelmed. ",
