        "exact_quote": "I anticipated engaging conversations, but instead, I found it challenging to formulate my own thoughts in such a dynamic environment. As someone who tends to reflect deeply before sharing, this experience has proved to be quite taxing and has made me question if this is the right platform for me to explore my passion for reading.",
