        "exact_quote": "However, as I navigated through the platform, I realized that the experience was quite solitary and felt more like browsing a website than participating in an engaging social event. There were no live discussions or chats to share thoughts about the items, which made the whole thing feel a bit hollow, especially for an event that aimed to have a community feel. ",
