          {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I've been involved in planning events for my community lately, but I'm not sure if I should continue with it. What do you think?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's recent experiences and feelings about planning community events?\",\"output_slot\":\"event_experience\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's recent experiences and feelings about planning community events?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"2261ca68807a8c5d216c875ffe364d68812df14cd6a85141a035a204ac122fd8\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"c48876d39afd443f8bf75b3827af6aef19c9c50ed9a81f282e3df7c48a17bfa8\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"0c279655aa3e6532d7c207ec52fa91cf587c7fedc01351de965cc12941912b25\"},\"variables\":{\"event_experience\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"event_experience\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"recent\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"event_experience\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"event_experience\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"recent\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_081b03b12025a5b20c680539\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has had a mix of recent experiences with community event planning. They organized a book swap that became overwhelming and stressful due to logistics, leaving them disheartened about future events. However, they also successfully conducted an engaging author interview that generated community excitement and felt rewarding. They joined a reading marathon for charity that fostered a strong sense of community and camaraderie. They started a regular volunteering schedule at the local library, which they find fulfilling and rewarding. On the other hand, they joined a community buying group that was less engaging and disappointing due to lack of dynamic interactions and clear direction. Overall, their recent experiences include both positive and negative feelings about community involvement.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s40\",\"s21\",\"s13\",\"s5\",\"s20\",\"s39\",\"s32\",\"s12\",\"s47\",\"s22\",\"s48\",\"s30\",\"s31\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s49\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"recent\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user describes multiple recent community event experiences: a stressful book swap (s3-s5), a rewarding author interview (s12-s13), a positive reading marathon (s30-s32), fulfilling library volunteering (s39-s40), and a disappointing buying group (s20-s22, s47-s49). These sources collectively support a mixed summary of recent experiences and feelings.\",\"variable\":\"event_experience\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,458,\"User: Organizing the book swap seemed like a delightful idea initially, but as I delved into the planning stage, the complexities started to unfold in ways I hadn't anticipated. The thoughts of coordinating different genres, managing people's varying schedules, and ensuring there were enough participants to make it worthwhile all became overwhelming. \",\"user\",[42]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",458,800,\"I found myself trying to devise a system that would work for everyone involved, but with each attempt, I felt more and more stressed rather than excited. The logistics of gathering different books, sorting them by category, and then figuring out how to distribute them fairly seemed like a task that was becoming more daunting by the minute. \",\"user\",[42]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",800,1014,\"Ultimately, it seemed that I was investing too much time and energy into something that was supposed to be a fun community experience, which left me feeling disheartened about pursuing similar events in the future.\",\"user\",[42]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",105,457,\"User: Lastly, I successfully conducted an engaging interview with a well-known author, which led to an exciting community event. The experience of speaking with someone who has had such a profound impact on the literary world was awe-inspiring. I learned so much not only about their writing process but also about their personal journey as an author. \",\"user\",[67]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",457,640,\"It felt like stepping into a world that was both familiar and completely new. Seeing the immediate excitement it generated in the community really made all the preparation worthwhile.\",\"user\",[67]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",107,359,\"User: Lastly, I joined a community-based buying group, but I found it less engaging than I anticipated. Initially, I was excited about the idea of being part of a collective, where people share and collaborate on purchases to benefit from bulk buying. \",\"user\",[138]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",359,728,\"I imagined engaging discussions with like-minded individuals about our shared interests and needs, perhaps even discovering new products or services I had never considered before. However, as time went on, I noticed that the interactions weren't as dynamic or fulfilling as I had hoped; there wasn't much enthusiasm in the conversations, and it felt somewhat stagnant. \",\"user\",[138]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",728,874,\"Additionally, I realized that the group didn't have a clear focus or direction, which contributed to my sense of disengagement and disappointment.\",\"user\",[138]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",105,450,\"User: I even joined a reading marathon for charity! It was a structured event that promoted community involvement, where participants from diverse backgrounds came together to share their love for reading. The organization of the event was meticulous, with schedules, reading lists, and even group discussions planned to enhance our experience. \",\"user\",[63]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",450,761,\"I witnessed how everyone was not just focused on individual achievements, but also on encouraging one another and celebrating our collective progress. It was refreshing to see people's eyes light up when they talked about their favorite books, creating bonds that seemed to transcend the pages we were turning. \",\"user\",[63]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",761,910,\"Ultimately, I found a real sense of community in the challenge, as we all cheered each other on and exchanged thoughts about our literary adventures.\",\"user\",[63]],[\"s39\",\"d5\",107,396,\"User: On a positive note, I started a regular volunteering schedule at the local library. It's been a great way to engage with the community and help out with outreach programs. Every week, I look forward to connecting with people of all ages who share a passion for reading and learning. \",\"user\",[147]],[\"s40\",\"d5\",396,630,\"There’s something special about watching children’s faces light up when they discover a new book or hear a story being read aloud. It’s rewarding to think that I’m playing a small part in fostering a love for literacy in my community.\",\"user\",[147]],[\"s47\",\"d6\",107,342,\"User: I thought being part of a community-based buying group would be a great way to connect with others who share similar interests and values, especially since it promised the potential for bulk discounts on items we frequently use. \",\"user\",[140]],[\"s48\",\"d6\",342,721,\"However, after attending a few meetings, I realized that the dynamics were quite different from what I had imagined, lacking the vibrant exchanges and enthusiastic interactions that I had hoped for. I was particularly looking forward to discussing various products and hearing diverse opinions, as I believed this would enrich my shopping experience and decision-making process. \",\"user\",[140]],[\"s49\",\"d6\",721,1007,\"Instead, the conversations felt a bit mundane and not as engaging as I had anticipated, making me question the value of my membership. As I sat there, I couldn't help but think that perhaps my expectations had been set too high or that this particular group wasn't the right fit for me.\",\"user\",[140]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",1020,1348,\"Assistant: It's understandable to feel that way, especially when you join a group with certain hopes and expectations that don’t fully materialize in reality. Engaging with a community can often be an enriching experience, and when that doesn’t happen, it can lead to feelings of disappointment, which can be quite frustrating. \",\"assistant\",[141]],[\"s50\",\"d6\",1007,1020,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",1348,1730,\"The initial excitement you felt about sharing ideas and learning from others is significant, and when that expectation is not fulfilled, it can feel like a missed opportunity for personal growth and social interaction. Sometimes, it takes a few tries to find the right community that resonates with one’s values and interests, as different groups have unique cultures and dynamics. \",\"assistant\",[141]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",1730,2063,\"Perhaps taking a step back to evaluate what aspects you found lacking could help guide you to either enhance your experience in this group or find another one that might be more engaging, allowing you to still enjoy those discussions on products and personal recommendations that initially drew you to the concept of a buying group. \",\"assistant\",[141]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",2063,2288,\"Remember, the journey of connecting with like-minded individuals can sometimes be a winding road, and it’s completely normal to reassess your participation in various pursuits in order to find the ones that truly fulfill you.\",\"assistant\",[141]],[\"s55\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 19–20 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s56\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s57\",\"d7\",105,438,\"User: In fact, I curated a list of must-read books for a community newsletter. It was gratifying to craft something that I hope could inspire and encourage readers all around me. Diving into the world of literature and selecting titles that resonate with different audiences is a unique challenge, but one that is deeply fulfilling. \",\"user\",[19]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",438,707,\"Each book carries its own unique message and has the potential to change perspectives, and I find joy in sharing those insights with others. It provides me a sense of connection with my community, knowing that I might influence someone’s reading journey for the better.\",\"user\",[19]],[\"s59\",\"d7\",707,720,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",720,1011,\"Assistant: That's a wonderful way to give back to the community. It must feel great to help others find good reads that could enrich their lives in various ways. By curating such a list, you're not just sharing books; you're also fostering a love for reading that can bring people together. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",1011,1301,\"Literature has a magical way of connecting individuals, allowing conversations to flourish over shared stories and themes. The process of selecting must-read books itself can be introspective, as it often involves reflecting on what you believe is not just popular, but what truly matters. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",1301,1672,\"Additionally, making recommendations can spark discussions about different genres, allowing you to explore deeper topics like the significance of storytelling across cultures. It is incredible how one recommendation can lead to a profound appreciation for authors and their craft, and the influence you have in guiding readers toward meaningful literature is invaluable. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",1672,1776,\"I'm sure your community appreciates the effort and thoughtfulness that goes into compiling that list. ])\",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s64\",\"d8\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 38–39 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s65\",\"d8\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s66\",\"d8\",105,336,\"User: I signed up for a reading marathon, but it became overwhelming with the length and pace. The thought of immersing myself in so many books excited me initially, as I'm always looking for new ways to enhance my reading habits. \",\"user\",[38]],[\"s67\",\"d8\",336,663,\"However, as the days passed, I found myself grappling with the sheer volume of material to cover, which made the experience feel less like a joyful exploration and more like a daunting obligation. I had hoped to escape into the stories and lose track of time, but instead, I felt the pressure mounting as deadlines approached. \",\"user\",[38]],[\"s68\",\"d8\",663,822,\"It’s disheartening when something you’re passionate about transforms into a source of stress, overshadowing the joy of reading that I’ve cherished for so long.\",\"user\",[38]],[\"s69\",\"d8\",822,835,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s70\",\"d8\",835,1210,\"Assistant: It can be tough to maintain that energy for a marathon format. The excitement that comes with participating in such an event can quickly morph into a sense of pressure when the expectations become overwhelming. I completely understand how the initial thrill can give way to feelings of anxiety as the reading list keeps growing, leaving little room for enjoyment. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s71\",\"d8\",1210,1398,\"It’s important to remember that reading should be a pleasurable experience, one that allows you to escape and explore different worlds, rather than a rigorous test of speed and endurance. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s72\",\"d8\",1398,1792,\"Perhaps taking a step back to reevaluate your goals for the marathon could help; focusing on quality over quantity might reignite that spark and allow you to savor the stories, rather than racing through them at breakneck speed. Additionally, consider integrating breaks or lighter reads to balance out the heavier material, offering your mind a chance to refresh and process what you’ve read. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s73\",\"d8\",1792,2191,\"Ultimately, the goal should be to foster a love for reading that brings you joy, not a sense of obligation or stress, reminding ourselves that it's perfectly okay to adjust our approach to fit our personal pace and passion. Plus, there are always more books awaiting our attention in the future, so rather than feeling pressured, you might find it liberating to read at your own comfortable rhythm. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s74\",\"d8\",2191,2193,\"])\",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s75\",\"d9\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 21–22 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d9\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s77\",\"d9\",105,455,\"User: Volunteering at a library where I helped organize book recommendations for patrons was an incredibly rewarding experience that deepened my appreciation for literature. There is something profoundly satisfying about assisting others in finding the right book that resonates with them, enhancing their reading journey through curated selections. \",\"user\",[21]],[\"s78\",\"d9\",455,740,\"Each book has its unique charm and potential to transport readers to another world or teach them something new, and being part of that process felt meaningful. It was also a joy to interact with patrons from various backgrounds, each with their unique stories and reading preferences. \",\"user\",[21]],[\"s79\",\"d9\",740,859,\"Knowing that my efforts contributed to fostering a community devoted to reading made every moment spent there worth it.\",\"user\",[21]],[\"s80\",\"d9\",859,872,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s81\",\"d9\",872,1251,\"Assistant: Volunteering at a library is indeed such a noble way to connect with fellow readers, and it often creates a profound sense of belonging that extends beyond the physical space of the library. When you help patrons discover books that they might treasure, you become a bridge connecting them to timeless stories and valuable insights that the written word has to offer. \",\"assistant\",[22]],[\"s82\",\"d9\",1251,1595,\"Libraries serve as crucial community hubs where individuals can gather, share ideas, and indulge in discussions about literature while cultivating a shared passion for reading. It's fascinating how, through a single book recommendation, one can spark someone's imagination or inspire them to delve into new genres they haven't explored before. \",\"assistant\",[22]],[\"s83\",\"d9\",1595,1809,\"The joy that comes from witnessing that spark in others, as they uncover their next great read, is genuinely uplifting, and it resonates long after the bookmarks have been placed and the library doors have closed. \",\"assistant\",[22]],[\"s84\",\"d9\",1809,2037,\"Moreover, it is heartening to know that by promoting literacy and access to information, volunteers contribute to the overall enrichment of the community, fostering a love for lifelong learning that can transcend generations. ])\",\"assistant\",[22]],[\"s85\",\"d10\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 32–33 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s86\",\"d10\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s87\",\"d10\",105,455,\"User: I even started a blog about book reviews, but I lost interest quickly. It felt more like a chore at times. I had all these grand ideas about expressing my thoughts on various novels and sharing them with potential readers. However, as the weeks went by, the excitement fizzled out, and it became daunting to even consider writing another post. \",\"user\",[32]],[\"s88\",\"d10\",455,723,\"The joy I initially felt while discussing character arcs and plot twists was overshadowed by the pressure to consistently produce content. It was as if the very act of sharing my passion had turned into an obligation that drained my enthusiasm rather than igniting it.\",\"user\",[32]],[\"s89\",\"d10\",723,736,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s90\",\"d10\",736,1117,\"Assistant: That’s understandable. Blogging can feel demanding if it’s not done for fun, especially when you start to think of it as a task rather than an enjoyable hobby. Many people begin their blogging journeys with a strong passion, but when the realities of regular updates and audience engagement set in, it can turn what was once a source of joy into a stressful obligation. \",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s91\",\"d10\",1117,1503,\"Every time you sit down to write, the looming deadline can overshadow the creative process, causing frustration and even burnout, which is something that many content creators experience. Moreover, the constant comparison with other bloggers who seem to effortlessly maintain their engagement can add to the pressure, making it easy to lose sight of why you started in the first place. \",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s92\",\"d10\",1503,1840,\"Finding joy in writing again, whether through a personal diary, a more informal blog, or simply for yourself, can sometimes reignite that spark you had when you first began. Remember that it’s completely okay to step back and reassess your interests and motivations, allowing you to return to your writing when it feels right for you. ])\",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s93\",\"d11\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 3–4 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s94\",\"d11\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s95\",\"d11\",103,424,\"User: For starters, I joined a local book club focused on contemporary fiction. This decision came after realizing how much I missed discussing books with others, especially after spending so much time reading alone. The club has opened my eyes to new authors and perspectives that I might never have explored on my own. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s96\",\"d11\",424,769,\"Connecting with others who share similar interests in narrative styles and themes has also enriched my understanding of contemporary issues reflected in literature. I've found myself excitedly anticipating each meeting, as they not only discuss the stories themselves, but also the emotional and cultural contexts that inform these modern works.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s97\",\"d11\",769,782,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s98\",\"d11\",782,1047,\"Assistant: That sounds wonderful! Book clubs can really enhance the reading experience in remarkable ways. They provide a unique platform for people to come together, share ideas, and delve into discussions that extend far beyond the pages of the books themselves. \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s99\",\"d11\",1047,1407,\"In addition to gaining new insights, it’s amazing how they create a sense of community among participants, allowing friendships to blossom over a shared love for reading. Engaging with diverse viewpoints can challenge our own interpretations and lead to profound conversations about themes, characters, and even the societal issues that the stories highlight. \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s100\",\"d11\",1407,1687,\"Furthermore, it's impressive that you're actively seeking new experiences and learning but also fostering connections that enrich your life in unexpected ways. The joy of literature not only lies in the stories we read, but also in the relationships we build with fellow readers. \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s101\",\"d11\",1687,2005,\"I can only imagine the rich discussions that take place during your meetings, especially when everyone brings their own unique background and experiences to the table. Have you found any particular book or author so far that has resonated deeply with you or sparked an especially lively discussion within the group? ])\",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s102\",\"d12\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 162–163 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s103\",\"d12\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s104\",\"d12\",107,450,\"User: On a creative note, I formed a partnership with local artists to create unique book-themed merchandise for upcoming events. Working together has opened up an entirely new world of possibilities for our designs. It's fascinating to see how their individual styles are being blended with literary themes to create something truly special. \",\"user\",[162]],[\"s105\",\"d12\",450,779,\"I'm particularly thrilled about the prospect of showcasing these items at our future events, as I believe they will resonate deeply with book lovers and attendees alike. The whole process has invigorated my enthusiasm for both reading and community engagement, making every brainstorming session feel like a delightful adventure.\",\"user\",[162]],[\"s106\",\"d12\",779,792,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s107\",\"d12\",792,1088,\"Assistant: Collaborating like that can bring such fresh ideas into your projects, as the energy and creativity of local artists often inspire unique perspectives. It's not just about the merchandise itself but also about the stories and connections that each item can represent in the community. \",\"assistant\",[163]],[\"s108\",\"d12\",1088,1484,\"I'm curious to know more about your creative process, including how you selected the artists you wanted to work with and what kinds of themes you are integrating into your products. The inspiration derived from literature could turn into stunning visuals that reflect the characters, settings, or even pivotal quotes from beloved books, creating a strong emotional connection with your audience. \",\"assistant\",[163]],[\"s109\",\"d12\",1484,1780,\"Additionally, events that highlight local artistry often foster deeper relationships within the community and encourage potential collaborations in the future. So what are you creating together? I'd love to hear more about the specific designs or concepts that have emerged from your discussions.\",\"assistant\",[163]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"recent\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"event_experience\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_081b03b12025a5b20c680539\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s40\",\"s21\",\"s13\",\"s5\",\"s20\",\"s39\",\"s32\",\"s12\",\"s47\",\"s22\",\"s48\",\"s30\",\"s31\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s49\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:509ce0da1ea0c0265eb9b91f30f84f4cd5671b531cfe39b816649bacb7cf527f\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":42.0,\"observed_end\":43.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:02453c0199fead8ccd6aa7f890e87eb3dc3e3b3be57dfc442e1b7c71d7b1f5f7\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":67.0,\"observed_end\":68.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:419ca75d11c87357fa7c52a8dd6be949d819640e371a2cdddbb924088c031a08\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":138.0,\"observed_end\":139.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:aa9263bdaed0e225f35ebede725098268279be5f058748ff80d8df84531d3540\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":63.0,\"observed_end\":64.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d5\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:bcd386bba453082263b0dce2d9ece308eabd26a41f0d90ddca50be93e02e767d\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":147.0,\"observed_end\":148.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d6\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:51e5ac7df94a4aec21fc9d9736da