            "role": "user",
            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I've been involved in planning events for my community lately, but I'm not sure if I should continue with it. What do you think?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What past changes in the user's attitudes or circumstances might inform this decision?\",\"output_slot\":\"changes\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What past changes in the user's attitudes or circumstances might inform this decision?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"1e7234a6e536876a7d070ad50dbb50ac1e503a29d8ac7e9f7b53ce8ddf10f742\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"c48876d39afd443f8bf75b3827af6aef19c9c50ed9a81f282e3df7c48a17bfa8\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"0c279655aa3e6532d7c207ec52fa91cf587c7fedc01351de965cc12941912b25\"},\"variables\":{\"changes\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"changes\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"changes\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"changes\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_fd7d4a7b2524a4cab911a680\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has had a mix of positive and negative experiences with community event planning. Positively, they curated a book list for a community newsletter (s57, s58), successfully organized an author interview that led to an exciting community event (s12, s13), and joined a charity reading marathon that fostered a strong sense of community (s30, s31, s32). Negatively, planning a book swap became overwhelming and disheartening (s3, s4, s5), and joining a community buying group was less engaging and disappointing (s20, s21, s22, s47, s48, s49). These experiences show that while the user has found fulfillment and connection in some community activities, they have also faced stress and disengagement in others, particularly when logistics or group dynamics fell short.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s21\",\"s13\",\"s5\",\"s20\",\"s32\",\"s58\",\"s12\",\"s47\",\"s22\",\"s48\",\"s30\",\"s57\",\"s31\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s49\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations provide direct evidence of both positive and negative past experiences with community event planning and participation. These are summarized as a coherent whole, preserving the conditions and outcomes described.\",\"variable\":\"changes\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,458,\"User: Organizing the book swap seemed like a delightful idea initially, but as I delved into the planning stage, the complexities started to unfold in ways I hadn't anticipated. The thoughts of coordinating different genres, managing people's varying schedules, and ensuring there were enough participants to make it worthwhile all became overwhelming. \",\"user\",[42]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",458,800,\"I found myself trying to devise a system that would work for everyone involved, but with each attempt, I felt more and more stressed rather than excited. The logistics of gathering different books, sorting them by category, and then figuring out how to distribute them fairly seemed like a task that was becoming more daunting by the minute. \",\"user\",[42]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",800,1014,\"Ultimately, it seemed that I was investing too much time and energy into something that was supposed to be a fun community experience, which left me feeling disheartened about pursuing similar events in the future.\",\"user\",[42]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",105,457,\"User: Lastly, I successfully conducted an engaging interview with a well-known author, which led to an exciting community event. The experience of speaking with someone who has had such a profound impact on the literary world was awe-inspiring. I learned so much not only about their writing process but also about their personal journey as an author. \",\"user\",[67]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",457,640,\"It felt like stepping into a world that was both familiar and completely new. Seeing the immediate excitement it generated in the community really made all the preparation worthwhile.\",\"user\",[67]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",107,359,\"User: Lastly, I joined a community-based buying group, but I found it less engaging than I anticipated. Initially, I was excited about the idea of being part of a collective, where people share and collaborate on purchases to benefit from bulk buying. \",\"user\",[138]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",359,728,\"I imagined engaging discussions with like-minded individuals about our shared interests and needs, perhaps even discovering new products or services I had never considered before. However, as time went on, I noticed that the interactions weren't as dynamic or fulfilling as I had hoped; there wasn't much enthusiasm in the conversations, and it felt somewhat stagnant. \",\"user\",[138]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",728,874,\"Additionally, I realized that the group didn't have a clear focus or direction, which contributed to my sense of disengagement and disappointment.\",\"user\",[138]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",105,450,\"User: I even joined a reading marathon for charity! It was a structured event that promoted community involvement, where participants from diverse backgrounds came together to share their love for reading. The organization of the event was meticulous, with schedules, reading lists, and even group discussions planned to enhance our experience. \",\"user\",[63]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",450,761,\"I witnessed how everyone was not just focused on individual achievements, but also on encouraging one another and celebrating our collective progress. It was refreshing to see people's eyes light up when they talked about their favorite books, creating bonds that seemed to transcend the pages we were turning. \",\"user\",[63]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",761,910,\"Ultimately, I found a real sense of community in the challenge, as we all cheered each other on and exchanged thoughts about our literary adventures.\",\"user\",[63]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",107,342,\"User: I thought being part of a community-based buying group would be a great way to connect with others who share similar interests and values, especially since it promised the potential for bulk discounts on items we frequently use. \",\"user\",[140]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",342,721,\"However, after attending a few meetings, I realized that the dynamics were quite different from what I had imagined, lacking the vibrant exchanges and enthusiastic interactions that I had hoped for. I was particularly looking forward to discussing various products and hearing diverse opinions, as I believed this would enrich my shopping experience and decision-making process. \",\"user\",[140]],[\"s49\",\"d5\",721,1007,\"Instead, the conversations felt a bit mundane and not as engaging as I had anticipated, making me question the value of my membership. As I sat there, I couldn't help but think that perhaps my expectations had been set too high or that this particular group wasn't the right fit for me.\",\"user\",[140]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",105,438,\"User: In fact, I curated a list of must-read books for a community newsletter. It was gratifying to craft something that I hope could inspire and encourage readers all around me. Diving into the world of literature and selecting titles that resonate with different audiences is a unique challenge, but one that is deeply fulfilling. \",\"user\",[19]],[\"s58\",\"d6\",438,707,\"Each book carries its own unique message and has the potential to change perspectives, and I find joy in sharing those insights with others. It provides me a sense of connection with my community, knowing that I might influence someone’s reading journey for the better.\",\"user\",[19]],[\"s59\",\"d6\",707,720,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s60\",\"d6\",720,1011,\"Assistant: That's a wonderful way to give back to the community. It must feel great to help others find good reads that could enrich their lives in various ways. By curating such a list, you're not just sharing books; you're also fostering a love for reading that can bring people together. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s61\",\"d6\",1011,1301,\"Literature has a magical way of connecting individuals, allowing conversations to flourish over shared stories and themes. The process of selecting must-read books itself can be introspective, as it often involves reflecting on what you believe is not just popular, but what truly matters. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s62\",\"d6\",1301,1672,\"Additionally, making recommendations can spark discussions about different genres, allowing you to explore deeper topics like the significance of storytelling across cultures. It is incredible how one recommendation can lead to a profound appreciation for authors and their craft, and the influence you have in guiding readers toward meaningful literature is invaluable. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s63\",\"d6\",1672,1776,\"I'm sure your community appreciates the effort and thoughtfulness that goes into compiling that list. ])\",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s64\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 38–39 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s65\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s66\",\"d7\",105,336,\"User: I signed up for a reading marathon, but it became overwhelming with the length and pace. The thought of immersing myself in so many books excited me initially, as I'm always looking for new ways to enhance my reading habits. \",\"user\",[38]],[\"s67\",\"d7\",336,663,\"However, as the days passed, I found myself grappling with the sheer volume of material to cover, which made the experience feel less like a joyful exploration and more like a daunting obligation. I had hoped to escape into the stories and lose track of time, but instead, I felt the pressure mounting as deadlines approached. \",\"user\",[38]],[\"s68\",\"d7\",663,822,\"It’s disheartening when something you’re passionate about transforms into a source of stress, overshadowing the joy of reading that I’ve cherished for so long.\",\"user\",[38]],[\"s69\",\"d7\",822,835,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s70\",\"d7\",835,1210,\"Assistant: It can be tough to maintain that energy for a marathon format. The excitement that comes with participating in such an event can quickly morph into a sense of pressure when the expectations become overwhelming. I completely understand how the initial thrill can give way to feelings of anxiety as the reading list keeps growing, leaving little room for enjoyment. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s71\",\"d7\",1210,1398,\"It’s important to remember that reading should be a pleasurable experience, one that allows you to escape and explore different worlds, rather than a rigorous test of speed and endurance. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s72\",\"d7\",1398,1792,\"Perhaps taking a step back to reevaluate your goals for the marathon could help; focusing on quality over quantity might reignite that spark and allow you to savor the stories, rather than racing through them at breakneck speed. Additionally, consider integrating breaks or lighter reads to balance out the heavier material, offering your mind a chance to refresh and process what you’ve read. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s73\",\"d7\",1792,2191,\"Ultimately, the goal should be to foster a love for reading that brings you joy, not a sense of obligation or stress, reminding ourselves that it's perfectly okay to adjust our approach to fit our personal pace and passion. Plus, there are always more books awaiting our attention in the future, so rather than feeling pressured, you might find it liberating to read at your own comfortable rhythm. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s74\",\"d7\",2191,2193,\"])\",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s85\",\"d8\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 32–33 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s86\",\"d8\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s87\",\"d8\",105,455,\"User: I even started a blog about book reviews, but I lost interest quickly. It felt more like a chore at times. I had all these grand ideas about expressing my thoughts on various novels and sharing them with potential readers. However, as the weeks went by, the excitement fizzled out, and it became daunting to even consider writing another post. \",\"user\",[32]],[\"s88\",\"d8\",455,723,\"The joy I initially felt while discussing character arcs and plot twists was overshadowed by the pressure to consistently produce content. It was as if the very act of sharing my passion had turned into an obligation that drained my enthusiasm rather than igniting it.\",\"user\",[32]],[\"s89\",\"d8\",723,736,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s90\",\"d8\",736,1117,\"Assistant: That’s understandable. Blogging can feel demanding if it’s not done for fun, especially when you start to think of it as a task rather than an enjoyable hobby. Many people begin their blogging journeys with a strong passion, but when the realities of regular updates and audience engagement set in, it can turn what was once a source of joy into a stressful obligation. \",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s91\",\"d8\",1117,1503,\"Every time you sit down to write, the looming deadline can overshadow the creative process, causing frustration and even burnout, which is something that many content creators experience. Moreover, the constant comparison with other bloggers who seem to effortlessly maintain their engagement can add to the pressure, making it easy to lose sight of why you started in the first place. \",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s92\",\"d8\",1503,1840,\"Finding joy in writing again, whether through a personal diary, a more informal blog, or simply for yourself, can sometimes reignite that spark you had when you first began. Remember that it’s completely okay to step back and reassess your interests and motivations, allowing you to return to your writing when it feels right for you. ])\",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s93\",\"d9\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 3–4 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s94\",\"d9\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s95\",\"d9\",103,424,\"User: For starters, I joined a local book club focused on contemporary fiction. This decision came after realizing how much I missed discussing books with others, especially after spending so much time reading alone. The club has opened my eyes to new authors and perspectives that I might never have explored on my own. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s96\",\"d9\",424,769,\"Connecting with others who share similar interests in narrative styles and themes has also enriched my understanding of contemporary issues reflected in literature. I've found myself excitedly anticipating each meeting, as they not only discuss the stories themselves, but also the emotional and cultural contexts that inform these modern works.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s97\",\"d9\",769,782,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s98\",\"d9\",782,1047,\"Assistant: That sounds wonderful! Book clubs can really enhance the reading experience in remarkable ways. They provide a unique platform for people to come together, share ideas, and delve into discussions that extend far beyond the pages of the books themselves. \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s99\",\"d9\",1047,1407,\"In addition to gaining new insights, it’s amazing how they create a sense of community among participants, allowing friendships to blossom over a shared love for reading. Engaging with diverse viewpoints can challenge our own interpretations and lead to profound conversations about themes, characters, and even the societal issues that the stories highlight. \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s100\",\"d9\",1407,1687,\"Furthermore, it's impressive that you're actively seeking new experiences and learning but also fostering connections that enrich your life in unexpected ways. The joy of literature not only lies in the stories we read, but also in the relationships we build with fellow readers. \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s101\",\"d9\",1687,2005,\"I can only imagine the rich discussions that take place during your meetings, especially when everyone brings their own unique background and experiences to the table. Have you found any particular book or author so far that has resonated deeply with you or sparked an especially lively discussion within the group? ])\",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s110\",\"d10\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 1–2 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s111\",\"d10\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s112\",\"d10\",103,467,\"User: I've recently explored my passion for books more deeply this year. It has been a transformative journey as I have immersed myself in various genres that pique my interest, ranging from classic literature to contemporary novels. I've found that reading not only enriches my imagination but also enhances my understanding of diverse cultures and perspectives. \",\"user\",[1]],[\"s113\",\"d10\",467,749,\"With each book I pick up, I discover new worlds that broaden my horizons and challenge my viewpoints. This newfound engagement with literature has ignited a desire to share my thoughts and interpretations with others, perhaps leading to discussions or even book clubs in the future.\",\"user\",[1]],[\"s114\",\"d10\",749,762,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s115\",\"d10\",762,1079,\"Assistant: That sounds absolutely wonderful, and it’s inspiring to hear how deeply you've engaged with your passion for reading. Literature possesses a unique power to transport us beyond our immediate surroundings and offer insights into the human experience, which is precisely why many people find such joy in it. \",\"assistant\",[2]],[\"s116\",\"d10\",1079,1437,\"Exploring different genres can indeed reveal the multifaceted nature of storytelling, whether through rich character development in fiction or the remarkable insights found in non-fiction narratives. Each book can serve as a gateway to understanding various societal issues, historical contexts, or even emotional journeys that resonate on a personal level. \",\"assistant\",[2]],[\"s117\",\"d10\",1437,1709,\"Furthermore, as you dive deeper into this literary exploration, you may find yourself connecting with fellow readers, nurturing a community that shares similar interests, and fostering meaningful discussions that could lead to new friendships and expanded perspectives. ])\",\"assistant\",[2]],[\"s143\",\"d11\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 143–144 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s144\",\"d11\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s145\",\"d11\",107,441,\"User: I've had quite a shift in my book-related habits this past month! It's interesting to realize how often our interests can change without us even noticing. Just this past month, I've found myself gravitating toward genres I would have previously overlooked, and it feels like a whole new world of literature is opening up to me. \",\"user\",[143]],[\"s146\",\"d11\",441,740,\"Instead of sticking to my usual favorites, I've been exploring diverse themes and styles that I never considered before. This newfound curiosity is not just refreshing; it's also enriching my perspective on storytelling as a whole, making me more understanding of different cultures and experiences.\",\"user\",[143]],[\"s147\",\"d11\",740,753,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s148\",\"d11\",753,1119,\"Assistant: That's fantastic to hear! Shifting your reading habits can truly be a transformative experience, often leading to unexpected insights and an expanded worldview. It’s quite remarkable how literature has this unique ability to transport us into different times, places, and minds, enabling us to connect with characters and their journeys in tangible ways. \",\"assistant\",[144]],[\"s149\",\"d11\",1119,1488,\"When you branch out into new genres or themes, you not only diversify your reading palette, but you also engage with a broader spectrum of human emotions and experiences, which can deepen your appreciation for the artwork of writing. This process can also inspire you creatively, as you encounter various narrative techniques that authors use to convey their messages. \",\"assistant\",[144]],[\"s150\",\"d11\",1488,1828,\"If you've discovered new genres or authors that resonate with you, it would be fascinating to hear what they are and how they've impacted your reading journey. Engaging with diverse literature can additionally spark discussions with fellow readers, enriching your experience and expanding your social connections around shared interests. ])\",\"assistant\",[144]],[\"s151\",\"d12\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 51–52 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s152\",\"d12\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s153\",\"d12\",105,503,\"User: However, I've realized that I needed to step back from blogging. In recent months, I found that the joy of sharing my thoughts on literature was overshadowed by the pressure to produce content consistently. Each time I sat down to write, instead of feeling excited about a new discovery in a book, I often felt weighed down by expectations, both my own and those I perceived from my readers. \",\"user\",[51]],[\"s154\",\"d12\",503,802,\"It got to the point where I was dreading my writing sessions rather than looking forward to them, which really highlighted how far I had drifted from my original passion. It was a tough decision to make, but stepping back from blogging has allowed me to rediscover that enthusiasm in different ways.\",\"user\",[51]],[\"s155\",\"d12\",802,815,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s156\",\"d12\",815,1098,\"Assistant: It's important to enjoy the process of engaging with literature, and it sounds like you've made a thoughtful decision based on your experiences. Taking a step back can be a very mature move, especially when it helps rekindle your passion for reading and discussing books. \",\"assistant\",[52]],[\"s157\",\"d12\",1098,1452,\"Focusing on direct interactions with friends can lead to more fulfilling conversations where you can share insights and differing perspectives in a more intimate setting. There's something special about verbal exchanges that can often enhance understanding and enjoyment of literature, as the spontaneity of conversation can lead to unexpected insights. \",\"assistant\",[52]],[\"s158\",\"d12\",1452,1787,\"So what specific topics or books have you been discussing with your friends recently? I'm curious to know what strides you've made in deepening those connections and how they compare to your previous experiences with blogging, as well as any new insights you may have gained about works that you thought you already understood well. ])\",\"assistant\",[52]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"changes\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_fd7d4a7b2524a4cab911a680\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s21\",\"s13\",\"s5\",\"s20\",\"s32\",\"s58\",\"s12\",\"s47\",\"s22\",\"s48\",\"s30\",\"s57\",\"s31\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s49\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:509ce0da1ea0c0265eb9b91f30f84f4cd5671b531cfe39b816649bacb7cf527f\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":42.0,\"observed_end\":