rie that is hard to replicate when reading alone. I would love to hear more about how this experience influenced your perspective on reading marathons and your ongoing literary interests. Did you discover any new authors or genres that sparked your enthusiasm? It's wonderful to see how reading can create not just personal growth, but also foster connections among like-minded individuals. ])\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"What are the user's general interests and values that might relate to community involvement?\", \"id\": \"user_interests\"}]",
