 if there are alternative formats for book exchanges that might be simpler to execute, like a potluck-style event or even a virtual swap, where the logistics could perhaps be less of a burden. On the other hand, if you're feeling disheartened, it could be worthwhile to take a step back and reflect on what made the idea appealing in the first place, as that might help you imagine new ways to engage with your community without the complications you faced. ])\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"What are the user's general interests and values that might relate to community involvement?\", \"id\": \"user_interests\"}]",
